to a constructor, e.g. `(a, b).1` to `a`.\nClass projections are not reduced; instances are handled by instance synthesis.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Reduce.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.reduceProjApp?","kind":"def","line":56,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.reduceProjApp?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/Reduce.lean#L56-L68"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Reduce.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.reduceZetaDelta?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">reduceZetaDelta?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">unfold</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.FVarId\">FVarId</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span> := <span class=\"fn\">fun (<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.FVarId\">FVarId</a>) =&gt; <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM\">SymM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Unfolds the let-bound free variable at the head of `e`, where `e` is the variable itself or an\napplication headed by it. The head position must be handled by the caller because the\nsimplifiers do not visit application heads. Beta-reduction of the exposed lambda is left to\n`reduceBeta?`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Reduce.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.reduceZetaDelta?","kind":"def","line":41,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.reduceZetaD